From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nyanmisaka <nst799610810@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 3 Jul 2026 21:16:35 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] lavfi/rkrga: swap the scale ratio for 90 and 270 degree
 rotations

verify_rga_frame_info() derives a scale ratio per axis from the
destination and source sizes and uses it twice. A ratio outside 1/8..8
moves the job from RGA3 to RGA2, and the final range check refuses a
ratio past the chosen core's limit.

A 90 or 270 degree rotation swaps the output's axes, so for those modes
each destination axis was divided by the wrong source axis. A rotated
scale RGA3 can do could then be routed to RGA2, which accepts no P010
or P210 and writes no NV15 or NV20, and the filter failed to configure
with ENOSYS. The same mistake could also trip the range check.

Pair the destination height with the source width, and the destination
width with the source height, when the rotate mode carries the 90
degree bit. That is the test the output sample aspect ratio already
uses.

The fix is nyanmisaka's, as jellyfin-ffmpeg carries it in its
debian/patches/0042 (jellyfin-ffmpeg commit 24bd5c9, "Sync fixes from
ffmpeg-rockchip").

Signed-off-by: nyanmisaka <nst799610810@gmail.com>
---
 libavfilter/rkrga_common.c | 10 ++++++++--
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/libavfilter/rkrga_common.c b/libavfilter/rkrga_common.c
index 5edcd2711c..208cd509df 100644
--- a/libavfilter/rkrga_common.c
+++ b/libavfilter/rkrga_common.c
@@ -879,8 +879,14 @@ static av_cold int verify_rga_frame_info(AVFilterContext *avctx,
     if (!src || !dst)
         return AVERROR(EINVAL);
 
-    scale_ratio_w = (float)dst->act_w / (float)src->act_w;
-    scale_ratio_h = (float)dst->act_h / (float)src->act_h;
+    if ((src->rotate_mode & 0x04) == 0x04 /* HAL_TRANSFORM_ROT_90 */ ||
+        (src->rotate_mode & 0x07) == 0x07 /* HAL_TRANSFORM_ROT_270 */) {
+        scale_ratio_w = (float)dst->act_h / (float)src->act_w;
+        scale_ratio_h = (float)dst->act_w / (float)src->act_h;
+    } else {
+        scale_ratio_w = (float)dst->act_w / (float)src->act_w;
+        scale_ratio_h = (float)dst->act_h / (float)src->act_h;
+    }
 
     /* P010 requires RGA3 */
     if (!r->has_rga3 &&
